{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34410","headline":"奉和袭美吴中书事寄汉南裴尚书 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美吴中书事寄汉南裴尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风清地古带前朝，遗事纷纷未寂寥。\n三泖凉波鱼蕝动，五茸春草雉媒娇。\n云藏野寺分金刹，月在江楼倚玉箫。\n不用怀归忘此景，吴王看即奉弓招。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}